      <p class="events-sub reveal d2">We've hosted 2 events so far — a founding dinner in August and a Cape Town Mastermind in October. No speakers, no panels. Just founders actually talking. This is what it looked like inside.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="events-video-strip reveal d1">
      <div class="event-video">
        <video autoplay muted loop playsinline>
          <source src="/videos/dinner-energy.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
        </video>
      </div>
      <div class="event-video">
        <video autoplay muted loop playsinline>
          <source src="/videos/dinner-conversation.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
        </video>
      </div>
      <div class="event-video">
        <video autoplay muted loop playsinline>
          <source src="/videos/dinner-table.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
        </video>
      </div>
      <div class="event-video">
        <video autoplay muted loop playsinline>
          <source src="/videos/ct-mastermind.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
        </video>
