<!-- ═══ 06 · THE FOUNDER ═══ -->
<section id="founder" data-screen-label="06 Founder">
  <div class="founder-inner">
    <div class="founder-portrait reveal">
      <img src="/images/founder-portrait.jpg" alt="Lliam Humphrey, founder of Private Victories Club" />
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="founder-label reveal d1">The Founder</div>
      <div class="founder-story">
        <p class="reveal d1">I'm 20. I built this because I needed it to exist.</p>
        <p class="reveal d2">In the last six months, I've helped businesses generate and collect close to $200,000 in revenue through remote sales. I've built content that's reached millions of people. And I've done almost all of it without a room like this one.</p>
        <p class="reveal d3">That's the part that stayed with me. Not the wins themselves, but how much harder they were than they needed to be. Information was never the problem. The right people were.</p>
        <p class="reveal d4">I noticed something early: proximity changes the game. Having people next to you who are winning makes you move differently. Having people ahead of you who've already figured it out shows you how far you can actually go.</p>
        <p class="reveal d4">That's what money can't buy. And that's why I built <em>PVC</em>.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="founder-sign reveal d4">
        <span class="founder-sign-name">Lliam Humphrey</span>
        <span class="founder-sign-role">Founder</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══ FAQ ═══ -->
<section id="faq" data-screen-label="FAQ">
  <div class="faq-inner">
    <div class="faq-header">
      <h2 class="faq-label reveal d1">Common<br /><em>Questions.</em></h2>
      <p class="faq-intro reveal d1">Everything you need to know about membership, how it works, and who it's for.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <div class="faq-item reveal d1">
        <button type="button" class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>WHAT HAPPENS AFTER I JOIN?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>It starts with a real conversation. We get on a call, understand where you're at, what you're building, what your goals are, and what's actually in your way. From there we plug you into the network and make your first introduction to a member or operator in the community who can directly help with what you're working on right now. You're in the community, the sessions, and the calls before your first week is out. You get real value before you've had time to wonder if this was worth it.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item reveal d2">
        <button type="button" class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>HOW WILL IT HELP GROW MY BUSINESS?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>PVC isn't a course and it's not a coaching programme. It's a network of people who are actually building, alongside operators who've already built. Your standard rises when the people around you are moving. You start thinking differently when someone two steps ahead of you is accessible. And the opportunities, the clients, the partnerships, the connections, they don't come from chasing. They come from consistently being in the right room. That's what PVC puts you in.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item reveal d3">
        <button type="button" class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>WHO IS THIS FOR?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Entrepreneurs already building and generating revenue — R10k/month minimum. You've started, you're moving, you have a real problem you're solving and skin in the game. Not someone looking for motivation to begin. Someone who's already in it and wants to be in an environment where the people around them are moving too. Not your age, not your stage. Just the standard.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item reveal d4">
        <button type="button" class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>DO I NEED TO BE IN SOUTH AFRICA?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>No. Geography doesn't matter. Standard does. We're built in Africa, open to anyone, anywhere, who's dialled in.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

